{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.Zeta4DescentCarrier","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.Zeta4DescentCarrier","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.HopfCubicOddCarrier","lean:module:QOU.QBeta.FMapDirectCyclotomic"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.uside_parity_descent_iff_order_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.uside_parity_descent_iff_order_four","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/Zeta4DescentCarrier.lean#L81-L89","doc":"**The formal bridge (composed).** Chaining KC17's\n`uside_parity_descent_iff_zeta4` (`FMapDirectCyclotomic`; descent ⟺ `q²=−1`)\nwith `descent_iff_order_four` (`q²=−1` ⟺ ζ₄): over `ℂ`, the u-side cyclotomic\nre-basing transports the fibre bar-parity to the `c_k` rungs **iff `q` is a\nprimitive 4th root of unity**. Importing this one file yields the combined\nstatement directly (not just the narrative link). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.cTotal_at_descent_image_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.cTotal_at_descent_image_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/Zeta4DescentCarrier.lean#L76-L79","doc":"The carrier value at the descent image is nonzero (non-degenerate odd\nchannel at `ζ₄`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.cTotal_at_descent_image","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.cTotal_at_descent_image","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/Zeta4DescentCarrier.lean#L70-L74","doc":"**The bar-odd carrier is non-degenerate at the descent image.** The total\nbar-odd Hopf-cubic carrier `cTotal` (KC20) evaluated at the descent-point\nimage `y = −2` is `−32 ≠ 0`: the odd channel is present at `ζ₄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.carrier_var_at_descent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.carrier_var_at_descent","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/Zeta4DescentCarrier.lean#L63-L68","doc":"**The carrier variable at the descent point is `y = −2`.** The bar-even\nloop-trace variable `y = q² + q⁻²` (argument of the Hopf-cubic carrier) at\n`q² = −1` equals `−2` — the antipode of the trivial `q = 1` value `y = +2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.descent_iff_order_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.descent_iff_order_four","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/Zeta4DescentCarrier.lean#L44-L61","doc":"**The descent point is a primitive 4th root of unity (`ζ₄`).** Over `ℂ`,\n`q² = −1 ↔ (q⁴ = 1 ∧ q² ≠ 1)` — the right-hand side is exactly the\norder-4-root condition. Combined with `uside_parity_descent_iff_zeta4`\n(`FMapDirectCyclotomic`), the fibre bar-parity descends to the `c_k` rungs\nprecisely when `q = ζ₄`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}